  "description": "COLLEGE STATION, Texas (Aug). 30, 2017) U.S. Navy Sailors assigned to Helicopter Sea Combat Squadron (HSC) 7 and Airmen from the 48th Rescue Squadron prepare for joint Search and Rescue (SAR) operations utilizing Air Force small boats and Navy Helicopters throughout the areas affected by Hurricane Harvey. The U.S. Navy and Air Force sent personnel and aircraft to the area to bolster Northern Command's support of FEMA's disaster response efforts. (US. Navy Video by Mass Communication Specialist 1st Class Christopher Lindahl/Released) 170830-N-KL846-001",
